om2
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note si/release-1.0/launch-kit/gate_launch_kit.om: Pure seeded-OM-2 verifier for SI 1.0 Launch Media Kit.
note
note Build:
note   seed/out/omc < si/release-1.0/launch-kit/gate_launch_kit.om > gate_launch_kit && chmod +x gate_launch_kit
note Run:
note   gate_launch_kit OMC_BIN KIT_DIR OMC_PIN_FILE SCRATCH_DIR
note
note Verifies fail-closed:
note   1. Compiler SHA-256 matches OMC_PIN_FILE (exit 69 on mismatch).
note   2. 2x bit-identical compilation of gate_launch_kit.om (zero stderr, identical SHA-256).
note   3. All 4 JPEG assets exist, start with JPEG magic (FF D8 FF), and are strictly < 1,000,000 bytes.
note   4. SHA256SUMS.txt parses cleanly, covers all 7 launch-kit files, and every file's FIPS 180-4 SHA-256 matches.
note   5. Policy audit on LAUNCH-KIT.md, llms.txt, and orca-automations.tsv:
note      - Zero /Users/ or /home/ hardcoded paths, zero retired GPU toolkit promotion, zero secret tokens,
note        zero UEFI/SPI commands, and all required content & relative asset markers present.
note   6. 7 live negative controls in SCRATCH_DIR (all MUST be caught):
note      - 1-bit SHA-256 tamper
note      - oversize JPEG (> 1,000,000 bytes)
note      - invalid JPEG magic (PNG header)
note      - hardcoded /Users/ path injection
note      - retired GPU toolkit token injection
note      - secret token injection
note      - tampered omc pin (+1 byte)

note ---- Embedded FIPS 180-4 SHA-256
global s2_ok ulong 1
global s2_k uint 64
global s2_h uint 8
global s2_v uint 8
global s2_w uint 64
global s2_buf uchar 64
global s2_n ulong 1
global s2_tot ulong 1
global s2_out uchar 32

note ---- Buffers
global g_omc uchar 4096
global g_kit uchar 4096
global g_pinp uchar 4096
global g_scr uchar 4096
global g_pa uchar 4096
global g_pin uchar 64
global g_d1 uchar 32
global g_d2 uchar 32
global g_av uchar 16384
global g_stb uchar 4
global g_fbuf uchar 65536
global g_cap uchar 131072
global g_sums uchar 65536
global g_std uchar 32768
global g_dg uchar 24
global g_seen ulong 16
global g_n ulong 32
note g_n:
note   0=omc_len, 1=kit_len, 2=pinp_len, 3=scr_len, 4=pa_len, 5=av_bytes, 6=av_argc,
note   8=cap_len, 9=sums_len, 10=std_len, 11=checks_pass, 12=controls_tot,
note   13=controls_caught, 14=fails, 15=sums_verified

